Z||000000||Lance||02-19-2000||03:36 AM||||Your friend Lance would like to converse with you over the Internet using Firetalk. Firetalk will allow you to communicate quickly, easily and cheaply (it's FREE from Firetalk Communications, Inc.) using a microphone and your computer. Why type when you can talk? <P>To download Firetalk, go to <A HREF="http://www.firetalk.com." TARGET=_blank>http://www.firetalk.com.</A>  Once you have installed Firetalk, don't forget to add Lance to your contact list by pressing the "Add/Find Contacts" button. <BR>||||reg||10
